-/-!
-# The unramified cyclotomic norm subgroup over `ℚ_p`
-
-This file joins the canonical-valuation form of the unramified cyclotomic theorem to the
-unramified norm computation. For a field generated by a
-primitive root of order `p ^ f - 1`, that theorem supplies the
-unramified extension of degree `f`; the result below expresses its norm
-subgroup in the spectral-norm presentation used by local class field theory.
--/
-
